e bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 14 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  14  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-ba2270a341605257END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-13466a59bb6d2227END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_GOB_VoloGoblinsGuide</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GOB_VoloGoblinsGuide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_GOB_VoloGoblinsGuide\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">96bd75c6-ab11-4b12-8c3a-b8cb47df1db8</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:96bd75c6-ab11-4b12-8c3a-b8cb47df1db8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:96bd75c6-ab11-4b12-8c3a-b8cb47df1db8\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>On a turret in the <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Camp\" title=\"Goblin Camp\">Goblin Camp</a>, near a wicker basket and pile of food waste at <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-92&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;442</span></li>\n<li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Piddle\" title=\"Piddle\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Piddle.png/25px-Portrait_Piddle.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Piddle.png/38px-Portrait_Piddle.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Piddle.png/50px-Portrait_Piddle.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Piddle\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9c/Portrait_Piddle.png/25px-Portrait_Piddle.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9c/Portrait_Piddle.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Piddle\" title=\"Piddle\">Piddle</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Usage\"> Usage </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Reading the book grants the inspiration <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_High_Chieftain\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/38px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/50px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Secrets of the High Chieftain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png/25px-Inspiration_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Inspiration_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Sage#Secrets_of_the_High_Chieftain\" title=\"Sage\">Secrets of the High Chieftain</a> to party members with the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/30px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/40px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png/20px-Background_Sage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Background_Sage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sage\" title=\"Sage\">Sage</a> background.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>[An excerpt from Volo’s forthcoming guide to goblin society, My Life Among the Conquering Host.] \n</p><p><br>\nIt has oft been noted that <a href=\"/wiki/Goblins\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Goblins\">goblins</a> are cowardly, tending to flee from robust challenges, and scattering far and wide if their leaders are felled. I tell you that it is not always so! The goblins of my recent acquaintance – fine though uncouth fellows by and large – have a fiery courage, fuelled by their love of the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute</a>. From the mighty magic-wielding <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Booyahg\" title=\"Goblin Booyahg\">booyahg</a> to the lowly muck- troubling <a href=\"/wiki/Goblin_Sapper\" title=\"Goblin Sapper\">pariah</a>, they seem more willing to fight – and indeed to die – for this new god than even the most stalwart devotee of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Helm_(deity)\" title=\"Helm (deity)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Helm_Icon.webp/11px-Helm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Helm_Icon.webp/17px-Helm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Helm_Icon.webp/22px-Helm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Helm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Helm_Icon.webp/11px-Helm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"11\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Helm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Helm_(deity)\" title=\"Helm (deity)\">Helm</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tempus\" title=\"Tempus\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Tempus_Icon.webp/14px-Tempus_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Tempus_Icon.webp/21px-Tempus_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c0/Tempus_Icon.webp/28px-Tempus_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tempus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c0/Tempus_Icon.webp/14px-Tempus_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c0/Tempus_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tempus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Tempus\">Tempus</a>. So far, I have been unable to discover the domain or provenance of this emboldening deity, but with every hour that passes, I come closer to the truth of the matter. For now, know this – priests and trusted devotees of this god, even be they goblins, are capable of wielding more powerful magics than even I can conjure!\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200747\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.077 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3158/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 42455/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14578/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1106542/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   57.223      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   57.223      1 -total\n 57.66%   32.996     12 Template:Icon_text\n 50.16%   28.701     27 Template:Trim\n 24.95%   14.279      7 Template:Icon_link\n 17.74%   10.150      2 Template:Uid\n 12.35%    7.067     12 Template:Ifempty\n 10.99%    6.288      1 Template:Main_only\n  9.87%    5.648      2 Template:Template_style\n  8.83%    5.054     12 Template:Icon\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:17267-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200747 and revision id 335714. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}